# The web member app was retired in 2026-08 (docs/PRODUCT.md#web-app-status).
# Everything it used to serve now lands on the marketing page. Member slugs
# (/patrick) are deliberately NOT listed: they fall through the catch-all as a
# 200 rewrite so the URL survives, which is what lets iOS/macOS resolve them
# against .well-known/apple-app-site-association and open the app instead of
# ever fetching the page. A 301 here would still work on Apple devices but
# would throw away the member context on every other one.
/join           /  301
/setup          /  301
/requests       /  301
/admin          /  301
/welcome        /  301

